# Server Management Rule

**DO NOT start new servers (frontend or backend) and DO NOT kill existing servers** because:

When making code changes:
- Simply save the files - changes will be applied automatically
- The development servers will hot-reload the changes
- No manual server management is required

This applies to both:
- Frontend development server (typically running on port 3000 or similar)
- Backend development server (typically running on port 8000 or similar)